Subject: [PATCH 103/105] dt-bindings: phy: mediatek,ufs-phy: Add MT6789

The MT6789 UFS M-PHY is compatible with the MT8183 one. Add its
compatible, used with the MT8183 fallback.

Signed-off-by: patrickjquinn <patrick.jm.quinn@gmail.com>
